# BF-2635: the two commits this seat could not publish

Applies on the published branch zc/bf-2635-native-host-artifact-release (head 3b4ca3b7c6), whose copies of
these two files are still the ones on main. After it lands the branch equals local commit e1bdc942f.

    git fetch origin zc/bf-2635-native-host-artifact-release
    git checkout zc/bf-2635-native-host-artifact-release
    git apply --check bf-2635-remaining.patch
    git apply bf-2635-remaining.patch
    git commit -m "BF-2635: package the native host from the release token folder; build, sign, notarize and attach it in the native release (Refs BF-2635)"
    git push origin zc/bf-2635-native-host-artifact-release

Two files: scripts/package-native-host.mjs and .github/workflows/native-mac-release.yml.
Why a hand patch: the workflow path needs the workflow permission this seat's App does not have (OPS-1127), and
the hosted secret scan refuses any write of the packager file because an unchanged line on main names a PEM header.

